cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the benchmark, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "robustfolio: a pre-registered portfolio evaluation benchmark"
abstract: >-
  A pre-registered evaluation benchmark for portfolio construction, with a
  published power audit and an out-of-sample replication. Seven constructions
  on 18 US ETFs over 168 out-of-sample months, plus a pre-registered
  country-ETF sample. The contribution is the evaluation: walk-forward
  validation, leakage tests, power analysis, numerical certification, and a
  reproduction check that compares decisions exactly and measurements within a
  documented bound.
authors:
